How We Do It Step-by-Step
Set up 3 pointers:

odd points to position 1.

even points to position 2.

evenHead saves position 2 so we don't forget where the Even group starts.

Hop across the list in a loop:

Point odd->next to even->next (skipping the even person to reach the next odd person).

Move the odd pointer forward.

Point even->next to odd->next (skipping the odd person to reach the next even person).

Move the even pointer forward.

Connect the two groups:

Once you reach the end, attach evenHead to the end of the odd list (odd->next = evenHead).


Time Complexity: O(N)
